# ✨ Features

## 👤 User Features

- 📊 Dashboard with personalized statistics
- 🥗 Diet program management
- 💪 Workout planning & tracking
- 💧 Daily water intake tracking
- ⚖️ BMI & BMR calculations
- 📈 Progress analytics & charts
- 📅 Daily activity monitoring
- 🎯 Goal tracking
- 👥 Expert subscription system
- 💬 Communication with Personal Trainers & Dietitians

---

## 🩺 Expert Panel

- Manage clients
- Create custom workout plans
- Create personalized diet plans
- Track client progress
- View health statistics
- Subscription management

---

## 🛡️ Admin Panel

- User management
- Expert approval system
- Content moderation
- Platform management
- Database administration
- System monitoring

